te journal record\n+ normalize the name and reject normalization failures\n+ reject per-owner fold and skeleton duplicates\n  preserve torn-final-line handling\n```\n\nThe alleged-name skeleton check remains a load-time exemption because `open` has no directory state.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- **Before:** replay applied `Set` records verbatim, bypassing `set()` validation (confirmed in the existing triage on #5225).\n- **After:** added fail-loud validation with journal line and invariant in the error, plus tests for fold duplicates, format characters, overlong names, skeleton duplicates, and a valid `set()` journal round-trip. `cargo test --manifest-path pkgs/id/Cargo.toml -p id-core petname` — **32 passed, 0 failed**. PR CI was queued/in progress at the last check.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** narrow — petname journal loading fails on invalid complete records; the journal format and torn-tail behavior are unchanged.","labels":[{"id":13198400136,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJWP4788AAAADEq-aiA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/labels/audit:complete","name":"audit:complete","description":"PR fully implemented spawning issue","color":"0e8a16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-12T20:06:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T01:22:40Z","closed_at":"2026-11-13T00:45:08Z","merged_at":"2026-11-13T00:45:08Z","merge_commit_sha":"ec536c5e22be0aceba1967e7c8a869a66fac6204","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.co